me was developed and tested by the author alone. When I was in primary school and was pulled into the arcade game hall by my classmates, I fell in love with games from then on. I am extremely passionate about games. Therefore, through continuous iterations, I finally made this game. I wish everyone a pleasant gaming experience~</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>[Official QQ Group]</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Front Runner]: 206879554</p>","developers":["\u5f00\u8def\u5148\u950b\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3687110","name":"[\u5f00\u8def\u5148\u950b]"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808640/5b01a4d6e83a452aafbabd09ded4acf54db354c6/header.jpg?t=1755080662","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"All the music used in the materials is produced by the working group. It is strictly prohibited to unpack or engage in any other infringement acts.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257153858,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153858/movie480.mp4?t=1754496522","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153858/movie_max.mp4?t=1754496522"},"name":"[\u5f00\u8def\u5148\u950b][\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247][\u4e00]","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257153858/ddd3818ee3a2ff71e9320ed8b5fbffd11c55c404/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754496522","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153858/movie480_vp9.webm?